 "rules": {
  "status": "unverified",
  "source": "owner (2026-10-22)",
  "text": "When Essence reaches a level's threshold the game asks: cash out or continue. Cashing out gives that level's reward and Essence starts again from 0. Continuing keeps the Essence for the next threshold. After a cashout the thresholds start again from level 1 (40 Essence): reaching a higher level means continuing past the lower thresholds without cashing out."
 }
